          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-gray-900">
            Colossi of Memnon
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
            See the massive twin statues that have stood guard over the West
            Bank for thousands of years.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="group p-6 border border-[#C9A24D]/20 rounded-2xl hover:border-[#C9A24D] hover:shadow-lg transition relative overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[3px] bg-[#C9A24D] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition"
          >
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-gray-900">
            Hot Air Balloon
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
            Enjoy a breathtaking sunrise view over Luxor’s temples and the Nile
            from a hot air balloon.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
